sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS (edge TLS)
    participant Auth as SATokenAuthMiddleware<br/>(opt-in)
    participant Agent as Agent (FastAPI)<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant LLM as OGX / vLLM / Ollama<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant MLflow as MLflow Server<br/>HTTP/HTTPS

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Client,LLM: Flow 1: Chat Completion Request
        Client->>Route: POST /chat/completions<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS (edge)
        Route->>Agent: HTTP/8080<br/>(cluster internal, no encryption)

        alt AUTH_ENABLED=true
            Agent->>Auth: Validate Bearer token
            Auth->>K8sAPI: TokenReview API<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS, SA token
            K8sAPI-->>Auth: TokenReview response<br/>(audience + allowlist check)
            Auth-->>Agent: Authenticated
        end

        Agent->>LLM: POST /chat/completions<br/>API_KEY (Bearer)
        LLM-->>Agent: Completion response<br/>(JSON or SSE stream)
        Agent-->>Route: Response (JSON / SSE)
        Route-->>Client: HTTPS response<br/>TLS (edge)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Agent,MLflow: Flow 2: MLflow Tracing (opt-in)
        Agent->>MLflow: Health check<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Bearer or SA token
        MLflow-->>Agent: Health OK
        Agent->>MLflow: Log traces (MLflow SDK)<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Bearer or SA token
        MLflow-->>Agent: Trace logged
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Client,LLM: Flow 3: OpenClaw Gateway
        participant OClaw as OpenClaw Gateway<br/>18789/TCP HTTP
        participant vLLM as vLLM Server<br/>HTTP/HTTPS

        Client->>Route: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS (edge)
        Route->>OClaw: HTTP/18789<br/>(cluster internal)
        Note right of OClaw: Auth: OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_TOKEN
        OClaw->>vLLM: Inference request<br/>VLLM_API_KEY
        vLLM-->>OClaw: Inference response
        OClaw-->>Route: Response
        Route-->>Client: HTTPS response
    end
